        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 4BB32D 4\" Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt is easy to install and packaged with stainless steel mounting screws. It can be surface mounted horizontally or vertically. Because it is constructed of all stainless steel, it is great for oudoor use and in harsh conditions (high corrosion environments). It has a long lasting, beautiful satin stainless steel finish. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-4BB32D.gif?v=1704354656\" width=\"599\" height=\"311\" border=\"0\" alt=\"4 Inch Stainless Barrel Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-stainless-steel-barrel-bolt-deltana-6bb32d\"><b>6\" Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-stainless-steel-barrel-bolt-deltana-8bb32d\"><b>8\" Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/10-inch-stainless-steel-barrel-bolt-deltana-10bb32d\"><b>10\" Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-stainless-steel-barrel-bolt-deltana-12bb32d\"><b>12\" Stainless Steel Barrel Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 4BB32D Stainless Barrel Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 13-16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Maximum Projection (including knob): 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Housing Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4BB32D.pdf?v=1691095271\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 4BB32D Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
